{"data": [{"author_id": "15310552", "created_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121747634008580540"], "id": "2121747634008580540", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2784141244", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121667668239646774", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@FDavidsonT I want ChatGPT and my dot to understand how I value cash versus points and optimize travel planning for finding award flights, taking into account flexibility, value of each points currency, etc. \n\nI just want a reliable points versus cash comparison tool", "url": "https://x.com/singy/status/2121747634008580540"}, {"author_id": "1572707645479587841", "created_at": "2026-11-14T23:07:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121741957856948596"], "id": "2121741957856948596", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hey @thsottiaux, could dots have their own email address? I\u2019d love to forward a thread or CC my dot and have it pick up the task, with my approval before sending anything. Would make it feel like a proper assistant.", "url": "https://x.com/BuiltByHally/status/2121741957856948596"}, {"author_id": "2027252334414434304", "created_at": "2026-11-14T23:04:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121741127703552481"], "id": "2121741127703552481", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Obligatory model when, but shout out to @OpenAI for my Dot noticing I accidentally booked a flight for my son under my name and pinging me to see if it was a mistake.  \n\nDot saved me $ by catching it in the 24 hour refund window and saved dad points with my son.  So glad he", "url": "https://x.com/Ker0Zelvin/status/2121741127703552481"}, {"author_id": "1562711773479702529", "created_at": "2026-11-14T23:03:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121740770332045730"], "id": "2121740770332045730", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121739467211862154", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Stormi is free w/ generous limits. \n\nPro is $9.99 /m\n\n- connect to 1700+ apps\n- 400 AI models\n- has its own computer\n- powerful as Grok Bot and ChatGPT Dots\n- and much more...\n\ntrystormi .com https://t.co/p9N3SnFLMS", "url": "https://x.com/yapsdotgg/status/2121740770332045730"}, {"author_id": "1696526718796959744", "created_at": "2026-11-14T22:49:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121737337491378235"], "id": "2121737337491378235", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How I type :((((\nMy dot .", "url": "https://x.com/Finn1552793/status/2121737337491378235"}, {"author_id": "95874218", "created_at": "2026-11-14T22:31:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121732813888348276"], "id": "2121732813888348276", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2784141244", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121718149045465554", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@FDavidsonT I plan almost all my vacations with ChatGPT, and now with my dot\n\nA few things:\n\n- taste-elicitation is missing. It took me ages to manually explain what I like and dislike, with feedback after almost every activity. A proper onboarding questionnaire that gradually learns your", "url": "https://x.com/literallydenis/status/2121732813888348276"}, {"author_id": "1659251884623032320", "created_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121727276853436579"], "id": "2121727276853436579", "in_reply_to_use